{"seq":3,"slug":"price-diff-settlement","title":"估价差异补退结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/price-diff-settlement","wordCount":2076,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"估价差异补退结算\">估价差异补退结算</h1><p>到检产生了一个实检价，报价锁定了一个承诺价，二者的差额必须有归宿。这听起来只是一个减法，但它牵扯到四条独立的约束：差额是补收还是退还取决于符号，补收要取得用户的支付授权，退还的落地方式受原支付渠道限制，而无法闭合的争议需要一条明确的升级边界。换新业务里最多的客诉不是「价格低」，而是「钱什么时候到账、为什么是这个数」——差异结算的设计质量几乎等价于用户体验的质量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-差额的两个方向与三种结算方式\">核心概念：差额的两个方向与三种结算方式</h2><p>差额的符号决定了完全不同的流程，这一分支必须在结算入口就确定，而不是在流程中间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  D[实检价 - 报价] --&gt; N{符号}&#10;  N --&gt;|&gt; 0 实检更高| U[退还差额]&#10;  N --&gt;|= 0| Z[无差额 直接闭合]&#10;  N --&gt;|&lt; 0 实检更低| C[补收差额]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[已有授权: 直接扣款]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[无授权: 请求用户确认]&#10;  C2 --&gt;|接受| C1&#10;  C2 --&gt;|拒绝| R[进入失败处置路径]&#10;  U --&gt; U1[原路退回]&#10;  U --&gt; U2[账户余额/礼品卡]&#10;  U --&gt; U3[抵扣后续订单]\">graph TD\n  D[实检价 - 报价] --&gt; N{符号}\n  N --&gt;|&gt; 0 实检更高| U[退还差额]\n  N --&gt;|= 0| Z[无差额 直接闭合]\n  N --&gt;|&lt; 0 实检更低| C[补收差额]\n  C --&gt; C1[已有授权: 直接扣款]\n  C --&gt; C2[无授权: 请求用户确认]\n  C2 --&gt;|接受| C1\n  C2 --&gt;|拒绝| R[进入失败处置路径]\n  U --&gt; U1[原路退回]\n  U --&gt; U2[账户余额/礼品卡]\n  U --&gt; U3[抵扣后续订单]</pre><p><strong>实检更高的情形在实践中应当被严格限制</strong>，理由是 <a href=\"../used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust\">估价置信度与到检调整</a> 里说明的不对称设计：允许上浮会激励用户低报成色套利。少数法域出于消费者保护要求双向调整，此时上浮是政策开关而非默认行为，且必须写进报价页条款。</p>\n<p><strong>补收的关键是授权</strong>。用户在下单时通常已经同意「按实检结果调整」，但这个同意是否构成对补收的扣款授权，取决于条款的具体写法与当地消费者保护要求。行业内的成熟做法是把授权与支付方式绑定：分期付款场景下，若到检后状态与描述不符，用户会被就差额收费；一次性付清场景下，抵扣直接抵减购买价，超额部分以礼品卡形式发放（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/trade-in\">Apple Trade In</a>）。两种方式的差别正落在授权范围上——分期场景有持续扣款的通道，一次性付清场景没有，因此后者的差额处理更多依赖事前的抵扣折扣而非事后补收。相应的授权分级是：小额差异（例如差额低于报价的 5%）走已授权的静默结算，大额差异必须重新取得用户显式确认，而这个分界点必须与 <a href=\"../tradein-order-link/tradein-quote-fail-handle\">估价不达标与放弃换新处置</a> 里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 分级保持一致，否则会出现「结算说可以自动扣、失败处理说必须用户确认」的矛盾。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差额方向</th>\n<th>结算方式</th>\n<th>需要授权</th>\n<th>落地速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补收（小额）</td>\n<td>原支付渠道扣款</td>\n<td>下单时的概括授权</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补收（大额）</td>\n<td>用户确认后扣款</td>\n<td>显式确认</td>\n<td>1–3 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退还</td>\n<td>原路退回</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>3–10 天（渠道而定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退还（替代）</td>\n<td>账户余额 / 礼品卡</td>\n<td>用户选择</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"支付授权的分级实现\">支付授权的分级实现</h2><p>授权分级不能靠一个布尔标志，它需要记录授权的范围、时点与凭据。这是因为授权是本地消费者保护法关注的对象，事后必须有据可查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE tradein_settlement_authorizations (&#10;  auth_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES orders(order_id),&#10;  scope         TEXT NOT NULL,      -- BROAD | EXPLICIT&#10;  max_amount_cents INTEGER,         -- NULL 表示无金额上限（仅 EXPLICIT）&#10;  granted_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_ref  TEXT NOT NULL,      -- 条款版本号 / 用户确认记录&#10;  revoked_at    TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE tradein_settlements (&#10;  settlement_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  order_id      BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES orders(order_id),&#10;  inspection_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES inspection_results(inspection_id),&#10;  quote_price_cents   INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  real_price_cents    INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  delta_cents         INTEGER NOT NULL,   -- real - quote&#10;  direction     TEXT NOT NULL,            -- CHARGE_BACK | REFUND | NONE&#10;  auth_id       BIGINT REFERENCES tradein_settlement_authorizations(auth_id),&#10;  status        TEXT NOT NULL,            -- PENDING | SETTLED | DISPUTED | WAIVED&#10;  settled_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  UNIQUE (inspection_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tradein_settlement_authorizations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auth_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- BROAD | EXPLICIT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_amount_cents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NULL 表示无金额上限（仅 EXPLICIT）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  granted_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 条款版本号 / 用户确认记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  revoked_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tradein_settlements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settlement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders(order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inspection_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspection_results(inspection_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quote_price_cents   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  real_price_cents    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delta_cents         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- real - quote</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  direction     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- CHARGE_BACK | REFUND | NONE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auth_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_settlement_authorizations(auth_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PENDING | SETTLED | DISPUTED | WAIVED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (inspection_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个结构的设计意图需要点明。<code>UNIQUE (inspection_id)</code> 保证一次验机最多产生一次结算，这是幂等的锚点：重复的结算请求会因唯一约束失败，而不是产生两笔补收。<code>evidence_ref</code> 把授权与具体的条款版本绑定——条款改了之后，旧订单仍然依据旧条款结算，这在跨境多市场运营里是必需的，因为同一平台在不同市场用的是不同条款文本。<code>revoked_at</code> 支持用户撤回授权，撤回后未执行的补收必须停止。</p>\n<h3 id=\"授权不足时的路径\">授权不足时的路径</h3><p>当差额需要补收而授权不覆盖时，流程进入用户确认分支。这里有一个产品设计上的选择：确认页应当同时给出<strong>接受</strong>与<strong>拒绝</strong>两条路的后果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;settlement_id&quot;: 55120,&#10;  &quot;delta_cents&quot;: -14300,&#10;  &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;CHARGE_BACK&quot;,&#10;  &quot;auth_scope&quot;: &quot;BROAD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;auth_max_cents&quot;: 5000,&#10;  &quot;exceeds_auth&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;user_options&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;accept&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;接受实检价，补付 143.00&quot;, &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;charge_original_channel&quot; },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;key&quot;: &quot;return_device&quot;,&#10;      &quot;label&quot;: &quot;原物退回，订单按原报价结算&quot;,&#10;      &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;refund_shipping_cost_covered_by_platform&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    { &quot;key&quot;: &quot;escalate&quot;, &quot;label&quot;: &quot;申请复核&quot;, &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;open_review_case&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settlement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">55120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"delta_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-14300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CHARGE_BACK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auth_scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BROAD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auth_max_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exceeds_auth\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"user_options\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"接受实检价，补付 143.00\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charge_original_channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_device\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"原物退回，订单按原报价结算\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_shipping_cost_covered_by_platform\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"escalate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"申请复核\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"open_review_case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第三条选项 <code>escalate</code> 的存在是必要的：如果用户只有「接受」与「退回」两条路，而退回的成本（时间、运费、设备被锁定）很高，用户感知到的是强制。给出复核通道能把一部分不满从流失转成流程内的化解。送回设备的运费由谁承担应当写明——在差异由平台判错导致时平台承担，在差异由用户误述导致时用户承担，这个归因依据的正是差异明细与证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退还与跨币种处理\">退还与跨币种处理</h2><p>退还差额看似简单，但跨境场景下有几个具体约束。</p>\n<p><strong>原路退回优先</strong>。多数支付网络的争议规则要求退款回到原支付工具，充值到余额或其他形式可能不符合要求，也容易引发「为什么没退到卡上」的投诉。只有当原渠道退回不可行（卡已注销、渠道不支持部分退款）时才使用替代方式，且必须由用户选择。</p>\n<p><strong>跨币种退还的汇率口径</strong>。若报价币种与结算币种不同，退还金额的汇率基准必须与原始扣款一致，否则用户会看到「付了 100 欧元，退了 97 欧元」这种由汇率波动造成的差额。稳妥的做法是记录原始扣款时的汇率快照，退还时用同一快照换算，汇率损益由平台承担（因为它是平台的定价选择造成的）。这一点与 <a href=\"../used-tradein-valuation/quote-validity-price-lock\">报价有效期与价格锁定</a> 里冻结汇率的做法是同一条原则。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>退还方式</th>\n<th>汇率基准</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同币种同渠道</td>\n<td>原路退回</td>\n<td>不涉及</td>\n<td>标准路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨币种同渠道</td>\n<td>原路退回</td>\n<td>原始扣款汇率快照</td>\n<td>汇率损益平台承担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原渠道不可用</td>\n<td>余额 / 礼品卡</td>\n<td>退款时汇率</td>\n<td>需用户选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抵扣未转实收</td>\n<td>仅释放挂账</td>\n<td>不涉及</td>\n<td>见订单联动篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"释放挂账与退还现金的区别\">释放挂账与退还现金的区别</h3><p>必须区分「退还现金」与「释放在途抵扣」。前者是平台把钱给用户，后者是用户从未被扣的钱不再被扣。两者的会计科目完全不同：退还现金是支出，释放挂账只是撤销一笔预计入账。在订单侧的实现是 <a href=\"tradein-credit-new-order\">换新抵扣与新品订单联动</a> 里的 <code>tradein_credit_ledger</code> 的 <code>RELEASED</code> 状态。把两者混在一个「退款」概念里会导致财务对账时无法区分现金流与科目调整。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结算的对账与状态收敛\">结算的对账与状态收敛</h2><p>结算记录最终必须收敛到一个确定的终态，否则会留下大量悬挂的 PENDING。收敛的驱动有两种：支付渠道的异步回调，以及超时对账。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def settle(settlement, channel_result=None):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;幂等收敛：PENDING -&gt; SETTLED / DISPUTED / WAIVED&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    if settlement[&quot;status&quot;] != &quot;PENDING&quot;:&#10;        return settlement[&quot;status&quot;]                # 已终态，直接返回&#10;    if settlement[&quot;direction&quot;] == &quot;NONE&quot;:&#10;        return &quot;SETTLED&quot;&#10;    if channel_result is None:&#10;        return &quot;PENDING&quot;                           # 等回调&#10;    if channel_result[&quot;outcome&quot;] == &quot;success&quot;:&#10;        return &quot;SETTLED&quot;&#10;    if channel_result[&quot;outcome&quot;] == &quot;insufficient_funds&quot;:&#10;        return &quot;DISPUTED&quot;                          # 转人工，不自动重试&#10;    return &quot;PENDING&quot;                               # 可重试的失败\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> settle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(settlement, channel_result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"幂等收敛：PENDING -> SETTLED / DISPUTED / WAIVED\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settlement[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PENDING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settlement[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]                </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 已终态，直接返回</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settlement[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"NONE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"SETTLED\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PENDING\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                           # 等回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"success\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"SETTLED\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_result[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"insufficient_funds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DISPUTED\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          # 转人工，不自动重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"PENDING\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                               # 可重试的失败</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计点有两处。<strong>幂等</strong>：函数入口检查当前状态，非 PENDING 直接返回，避免回调重复投递导致重复结算。<strong>区分可重试与不可重试的失败</strong>：<code>insufficient_funds</code> 这类失败自动重试没有意义，转人工是正确处置；网络类失败才值得重试。把所有失败一视同仁地重试，会在用户卡上产生一连串失败的扣款尝试记录。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; PENDING&#10;  PENDING --&gt; SETTLED: 渠道成功回调&#10;  PENDING --&gt; DISPUTED: 余额不足/渠道拒绝&#10;  PENDING --&gt; WAIVED: 平台豁免(归因平台)&#10;  PENDING --&gt; PENDING: 可重试失败&#10;  DISPUTED --&gt; SETTLED: 用户改用其他方式&#10;  DISPUTED --&gt; WAIVED: 复核改判&#10;  SETTLED --&gt; [*]&#10;  WAIVED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; PENDING\n  PENDING --&gt; SETTLED: 渠道成功回调\n  PENDING --&gt; DISPUTED: 余额不足/渠道拒绝\n  PENDING --&gt; WAIVED: 平台豁免(归因平台)\n  PENDING --&gt; PENDING: 可重试失败\n  DISPUTED --&gt; SETTLED: 用户改用其他方式\n  DISPUTED --&gt; WAIVED: 复核改判\n  SETTLED --&gt; [*]\n  WAIVED --&gt; [*]</pre><p>超时对账是最后一道网：超过 N 天仍为 PENDING 的结算必须被运维看到。这里的 N 应当按结算方向区分——退还的超时对用户是伤害，补收的超时对平台是损失，两者的优先级和话术不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>差额按符号分成补收与退还两条完全不同的流程；实检更高时的上浮是政策开关而非默认。</li>\n<li>补收必须区分授权范围：小额走下单时的概括授权，大额需显式确认；确认页应同时给出接受、退回、复核三条路。</li>\n<li>授权记录要绑定条款版本与凭据（<code>evidence_ref</code>），以支持跨境多市场与事后审计；<code>UNIQUE (inspection_id)</code> 是结算幂等的锚点。</li>\n<li>退还原路优先；跨币种退还使用原始扣款的汇率快照，汇率损益由平台承担。</li>\n<li>「退还现金」与「释放在途抵扣」是不同科目，不可混为一个退款概念。</li>\n<li>结算收敛函数必须幂等，且要区分可重试与不可重试失败（余额不足转人工而非自动重试），超时对账按方向设不同优先级。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"估价差异补退结算","id":"估价差异补退结算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：差额的两个方向与三种结算方式","id":"核心概念-差额的两个方向与三种结算方式"},{"level":2,"text":"支付授权的分级实现","id":"支付授权的分级实现"},{"level":3,"text":"授权不足时的路径","id":"授权不足时的路径"},{"level":2,"text":"退还与跨币种处理","id":"退还与跨币种处理"},{"level":3,"text":"释放挂账与退还现金的区别","id":"释放挂账与退还现金的区别"},{"level":2,"text":"结算的对账与状态收敛","id":"结算的对账与状态收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"到检验机与重新定级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/inspect-grade-regrade"},"next":{"title":"翻新转售与回收处置衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/circular-downstream-policy/refurb-resell-recycle-route"}}